BARANGAY BUSINESS CLEARANCE

REQUIREMENTS:
    A. Renewal of Business permit - old permit must be presented with the current CTC.
    B. New Business permit - applicant must accomplish some of the requirements such as Sanitary permit, etc 

STEPS ON HOW TO GET BARANGAY BUSINESS CLEARANCE

    1. Go to Barangay Hall with the supporting documents and log in on the record book with the purpose to the Officer of the Day.


    2. OIC/Secretary prepare the Barangay Business Clearance on the kind of business with the accomplished supporting documents, 
       current CTC for new permit, for renewal of Business permit, applicant must present old permit with the current CTC 
       and other supporting documents.
    
    3. Punong Barangay will sign the prepared Barangay business clearance and pay fee to Treasurer the 
       amount of ₱250.00 and additional fee for REL buisness accordingly for the issuance of 
       Official Receipt and release of Business clearance.